packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:452:- Fixed `pi.registerProvider()` to honor per-model `baseUrl` overrides ([#4063](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/4063)).
packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:483:- Added top-level `name` support to `pi.registerProvider()` so extension-registered providers can show a friendly name in `/login` ([#3956](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/3956)).
packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:581:- Fixed provider registration with override-only `models.json` entries to preserve built-in model lists ([#3651](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/3651)).
