packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:666:- Fixed `models.json` Anthropic-compatible provider configuration to accept `compat.supportsEagerToolInputStreaming`, allowing proxies that reject per-tool `eager_input_streaming` to use the legacy fine-grained tool streaming beta header instead ([#3575](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/3575))
