packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:699:- Fixed `models.json` built-in provider overrides to accept `headers` without requiring `baseUrl`, so request-header-only overrides now load and apply correctly ([#3538](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/3538))
packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:705:- Fireworks provider support with built-in models and `FIREWORKS_API_KEY` auth. See [README.md#providers--models](README.md#providers--models) and [docs/providers.md](docs/providers.md).
