packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:956:- Fixed custom models for built-in providers (e.g. `openrouter`) being silently dropped from `--list-models` by inheriting `api`/`baseUrl` from built-in model definitions and no longer requiring `apiKey` for providers with existing auth ([#2921](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/2921) and [#3072](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/issues/3072))
packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:959:- Added full `openRouterRouting` field support in `models.json`, including fallbacks, parameter requirements, data collection, ZDR, ignore lists, quantizations, provider sorting, max price, and preferred throughput and latency constraints ([#2904](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/pull/2904) by [@zmberber](https://github.com/zmberber))
