packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.upstream.md:1283:- Updated default models for `zai`, `cerebras`, `minimax`, and `minimax-cn`, and aligned MiniMax catalog coverage and limits with the current provider lineup. See [docs/models.md](docs/models.md) and [docs/providers.md](docs/providers.md).
